      "writtenOn": "2024-12-31T07:06:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "For the future proof, I think having `Map\u003cInt, PortDescription\u003e` would be better than `Set\u003cPortDescription\u003e`, since any other information is depending on port number. Defining a struct without any key value(port number here) can make us harder to find information for given specific port; we need to find via an iteration.\n\nThe reason for having `Map\u003cInt, String\u003e` is simple, since we don\u0027t have any other information beyond process name yet.",
      "parentUuid": "602d28cd_a8b55a9b",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 63,
        "startChar": 43,
        "endLine": 63,
        "endChar": 48
